[2022-03-13T20:40:59+08:00][sql] INSERT INTO `carver_article` SET `article_title` = 'ssh|sftp连接远程（非22）端口的方法' , `article_label` = 'linux' , `article_desc` = 'ssh|sftp连接远程（非22）端口的方法' , `article_content` = '<h4 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 41.6px; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">1、ssh连接远程主机方式<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></h4><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">ssh&nbsp;[-p&nbsp;port]&nbsp;user@hostname&nbsp;[command]</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">以上格式可以在终端中输入ssh -v得到更多选项信息，这里稍微解释一下：</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">-p port: 指定远程端口，一般默认是22号端口，除非你的远程主机改变了连接端口，此时需要用该选项指定</span></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">user : 指定用户，一般情况下我们默认没有写，因为我们习惯了用root管理员方式登录，连接远程主机时，也是root，那么此时可以不写，但，当远程主机用户权限控制的比较严，那么就得用管理员指定的账号登录了。以下是示例：</span></span></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">#连接远程主机192.168.0.8，用户为test,连接端口为2222
ssh&nbsp;-p&nbsp;2222&nbsp;test@192.168.0.8
#如果你当前登录的主机用户就是test的话，上面命令中test@可以不用写</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">再来一个，如果你只是想执行远程执行一条命令，不想登录太麻烦，可以这样操作：</span></span></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">登录远程主机并执行一个命令：python&nbsp;/root/getmac.py
ssh&nbsp;-p&nbsp;2222&nbsp;test@192.168.0.8&nbsp;\"python&nbsp;/root/getmac.py\"</pre><h4 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 41.6px; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">2、sftp传输文件<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></h4><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">以下是输入命令sftp -h的输出结果：</span></span></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">#&nbsp;sftp&nbsp;-h
usage:&nbsp;sftp&nbsp;[-1246aCfpqrv]&nbsp;[-B&nbsp;buffer_size]&nbsp;[-b&nbsp;batchfile]&nbsp;[-c&nbsp;cipher]
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[-D&nbsp;sftp_server_path]&nbsp;[-F&nbsp;ssh_config]&nbsp;[-i&nbsp;identity_file]&nbsp;[-l&nbsp;limit]
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[-o&nbsp;ssh_option]&nbsp;[-P&nbsp;port]&nbsp;[-R&nbsp;num_requests]&nbsp;[-S&nbsp;program]
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[-s&nbsp;subsystem&nbsp;|&nbsp;sftp_server]&nbsp;host
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;sftp&nbsp;[user@]host[:file&nbsp;...]
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;sftp&nbsp;[user@]host[:dir[/]]
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;sftp&nbsp;-b&nbsp;batchfile&nbsp;[user@]host</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">其中可以看出并没有列出连接远程端口的方式，我们可以这样操作：</span></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">sftp&nbsp;-oPort=2222&nbsp;test@192.168.0.8</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">那么我怎么知道要这样输入呢，我们来man sftp一下：</span></p><blockquote style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 1px dashed rgb(221, 221, 221); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; outline: 0px; padding: 10px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: none; quotes: none; width: 746.477px; color: rgb(139, 139, 139); clear: both;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-o ssh_option<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Can be used to pass options to ssh in the format used in ssh_config(5). &nbsp;This is useful for specify-<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ing options for which there is no separate sftp command-line flag. &nbsp;For example, to specify an<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;alternate port use: sftp -oPort=24. &nbsp;For full details of the options listed below, and their possi-<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ble values, see ssh_config(5).</p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-P port<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Specifies the port to connect to on the remote host.</p></blockquote><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; hyphens: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 2em; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;lucida sans unicode&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: inherit; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">so，我们也可以使用如下命令进行连接：</span></p><pre class=\"brush:bash;toolbar:false;\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; position: relative; border-color: rgb(209, 209, 209); font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 5px; outline: 0px; padding: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 30.4px; max-width: 100%; hyphens: auto; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">sftp&nbsp;-P&nbsp;2222&nbsp;test@192.168.0.8</pre>' , `article_guide` = 10 , `click_num` = 16 , `article_img` = '/uploads/20220313/1bd148af408fd964d8f201a449c9b286.png' , `is_show` = 1 , `is_top_show` = 0 , `article_author` = 'lijialong' , `add_time` = 1647175259 , `update_time` = 1647175259 [ RunTime:0.012316s ]
