[2022-03-13T22:46:54+08:00][sql] UPDATE `carver_article`  SET `article_id` = 60 , `article_title` = 'linux的scp占用端口,linux scp 命令使用及注意要点' , `article_desc` = 'linux的scp占用端口,linux scp 命令使用及注意要点' , `article_content` = '<p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">在两台linux系统 服务器下如何进行文件的copy呢？一直使用这个命名 scp(security copy)。</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">对这命令知其然不知其所以然，再次做一下总结：</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">大家都知道 cp 命令的使用是 cp [源文件地址(也就是要拷贝文件位置)] [目标地址(要拷贝文件的去向位置)]</p><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>例子： cp -r ./new_file&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;/test</b></pre><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">通过cp的使用 也大概知道了scp的使用了，</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">scp 同cp 一样也是要有 源文件位置 &nbsp;目标文件位置 但此时的要是在目标文件执行scp 命令</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">样例： <b>scp 远程源文件主机通过ssh登录的用户名密码 到目标主机地址</b></p><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>scp root@10.0.0.1:/home/test.zip  /home</b></pre><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">如果在执行名命令的位置在源文件主机上就是通过</p><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>scp /home/test.zip root@10.0.0.1:/home</b></pre><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">文件copy 如上，</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>要是进行文件夹的copy &nbsp;要加入 -r</b></p><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>scp -r /home/test  root@10.0.0.1:/home/</b></pre><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\">scp命名使用的注意要点：两台服务器之间的ssh <b>端口号不是22时</b> 要进行端口号验证</p><p style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>scp -P(此处是大写的P 因为小写的p已经被 rcp占用)</b></p><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>例子： scp -P 52222(目标主机的SSH 端口号)&nbsp; -r /home/&nbsp; root@10.0.0.1:/home</b></pre><pre style=\"outline: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif, SimHei, SimSun; line-height: 26px !important;\"><b>例子： scp -P 52223(目标主机的SSH端口号)  -r root@10.0.0.1:/home/test   /home/</b></pre>' , `article_guide` = 8 , `article_label` = 'php;linux' , `article_img` = '/uploads/20220313/9bcf1e5a27edc9b317e1698febc1bd76.png' , `is_show` = 1 , `click_num` = 333 , `is_top_show` = 0 , `update_time` = 1647182814  WHERE  `article_id` = 60 [ RunTime:0.008950s ]
